  :doc "Guest browser desktop with text (ADR-0224 .. 0234): browser-frame2 in the KIR oracle over five- and six-glyph fixtures cut from the committed font. 43 vectors, 27 whole op lists asserted: 1/2/4 windows, the body flow (ADR-0234: packing by words at w - 28 exactly and a pixel past it, collapse, <br> segments, overflow, the viewport clip), title clip, bottom cut, 16 px advance, the U+FFFD fallback, composition, caret, launcher; reasons -9..-1. About 25 seconds."}

