  :doc "Guest browser desktop input method (ADR-0225, dictionary ADR-0235): browser-ime in the KIR oracle, every vector against the committed os/aiueos/ime/aiueos-kanji.dic (sha256-pinned). 55 vectors / 205 key steps whose expected commits, romaji buffer, preedit and conversion words are the hosted aiueos.compositor.ime handle-key's over the same file, plus the object's own bounds (-1 -2 -3 -5 -6 -8, release, repeat). About 80 seconds."}

